Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.98,0:00:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I carry high my craven flag,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.56,0:00:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,my ally I'm gonna fly and let my\Nstruggles shoot me through the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be a pity if we\Nlingered here and let our
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.08,0:00:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,pretty sparks of life\Nblend aloud and disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.14,0:00:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There may be fog that even\Nyou can't navigate If someone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.20,0:00:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,strong like you is lost then\Nwho will set me straight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.92,0:00:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause when the waves\Ncast, my heart exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.78,0:00:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been your kindness and your strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.82,0:00:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That would free me from the mist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.14,0:00:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And just like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.82,0:00:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.04,0:00:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail to a new dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.62,0:00:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Weigh anchor, ride as high as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.40,0:00:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I assure I don't need anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.52,0:00:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I go fast as I am, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.66,0:00:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear you laughing like\Nyou're numb to it all?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.72,0:00:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, we're dashing together.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.70,0:00:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we're never gonna fall, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.16,0:00:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole world may now be my enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.70,0:01:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What a swirl, but I ain't\Nbacking down so long as I'm free!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.30,0:01:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought I'll give it. Come\Nround the current with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.24,0:01:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,All in, wake up bright and\Nearly, making for the peak we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.66,0:01:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All in, wake up bright and\Nearly, making for the peak we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.40,0:01:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A short time ago, before\NLuffy's departure,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.76,0:01:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,he made a visit to the\Nruins of Odin Castle,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.42,0:01:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,where the graves of Kozuki\NOdin and his allies once were.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.88,0:02:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,However, thanks to Kaido's blast breath,\Nthere was nothing left but destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.70,0:02:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Years ago, Odin built his first castle\Nthere when he became the Daimyo of Kuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.02,0:02:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the Daimyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.24,0:02:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.56,0:02:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.38,0:02:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there, Luffy Toto. Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.48,0:02:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.44,0:02:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are all of you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.60,0:02:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We came to tell Lord Odin\Nthat we won the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.38,0:02:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been rather eventful since we've\Nbeen away, so there's much to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.28,0:02:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Bigger question is,\Nwhy are you Karoo here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.98,0:02:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,To see Odin, same as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.14,0:02:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You two would have been\Ngood friends. I'm certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.60,0:02:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He would be honored to meet the man\Nwho saved his country from Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.90,0:02:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.52,0:03:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Odin, thanks to Sir\NLufitaro and his friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.22,0:03:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We defeated Orochi and Kaido.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.32,0:03:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,At long last, the land of Wano is free.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.16,0:03:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,As for Lord Momonosuke, he\Nhas become a beloved shogun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.38,0:03:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,With us beside him, he will make this\Ncountry a land of peace as it was before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.26,0:03:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Your people will smile again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.78,0:03:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I only wish that Ashura\Nand Iza were here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.36,0:03:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll always be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.98,0:03:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,For we will carry them in our hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.32,0:04:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as we do with Lord Oden.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.60,0:04:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well spoken.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.56,0:04:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're having their own banquet,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.24,0:04:08.71,Default,,0,0,0,,and they'll feast again when we join them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.04,0:04:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to keel over yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.86,0:04:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can't wait to have\Nour lord's ode in when I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.74,0:04:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't forgotten the flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.04,0:04:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And how could I?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.40,0:04:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the flavor of our friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.26,0:04:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It tasted even better after training.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.38,0:04:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We ate and ate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.02,0:04:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.42,0:04:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Wish I could try some, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.74,0:04:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.65,0:04:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If you guys know the recipe, we\Ncan have Sanji cook up a pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.02,0:04:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We should stock up on some\Ningredients to take on the Sunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.46,0:04:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.92,0:04:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And get as much as you can carry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.48,0:04:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.02,0:04:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you be leaving soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.54,0:04:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.90,0:04:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,With all our hearts, once\Nagain, we must thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.72,0:04:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We owe you our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.20,0:05:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut that out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.66,0:05:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We're friends, aren't we? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.70,0:05:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.08,0:05:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up, Carrot?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.40,0:05:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You, Chopper, can't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.98,0:05:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart can't take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.92,0:05:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to stay with you, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.04,0:05:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.06,0:05:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Carrot? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.42,0:05:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.70,0:05:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Because this is goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.86,0:05:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going back to Zou.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.74,0:05:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to protect my homeland\Nwith Wanda and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.36,0:05:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyagi, Tristan, thank you for\Nall your help. My pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.72,0:05:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Karoo, for teaching me\Nso much as a doctor and as a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.96,0:05:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't work too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.58,0:05:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Get good sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.90,0:05:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, I'm reminded of the first time we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.78,0:05:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,As I recall, Carrot, you\Nstowed away on the sunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.20,0:05:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems your dream to see the\Nocean came true in a big way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.60,0:06:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it all you hoped for?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.98,0:06:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It was all of that and more!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.06,0:06:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw crazy islands and went on big\Nadventures and made amazing friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.30,0:06:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It was scary sometimes, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.24,0:06:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think I came out of it\Na lot stronger than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.30,0:06:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe it all to you, Tia. So thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.84,0:06:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll treasure these memories\Nfor the rest of my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.42,0:06:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one last thing\Nfor us to do. Got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.20,0:06:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I had so much fun spending\Ntime with you, Tia-nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.26,0:06:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My Beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.30,0:06:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.14,0:06:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't forget my children.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.30,0:06:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That tickled carrot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.78,0:06:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad I got to be your bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.30,0:06:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.21,0:06:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was coming out here, I\Nsaw Zoro. Yeah? Where was he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.96,0:07:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.87,0:07:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,3 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.79,0:07:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,2 minutes. 2
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.70,0:07:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.34,0:07:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's share a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.82,0:07:44.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.76,0:07:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Having a few drinks with\Nyour old man, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.94,0:07:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pour one for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.44,0:07:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.48,0:07:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you put these flowers here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.46,0:07:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.37,0:07:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.29,0:07:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Big sis helped me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.20,0:07:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It was her idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.06,0:08:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro Giri, you came to pay\Nyour respects as well? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.28,0:08:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,May you rest in peace, Lord Yasui.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.20,0:08:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll build you a nice\Ntemple soon, promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.30,0:08:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll come and visit\Nyou all the time, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.04,0:08:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never be lonely with\Nme around, Dad. Right? Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.02,0:08:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems you came here to say farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.58,0:08:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean you'll be leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.28,0:08:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That the time has come?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.14,0:08:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.60,0:09:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I will certainly miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.96,0:09:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Not only you, I will also have to bid\Nfarewell to my father's beloved Enma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.30,0:09:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.94,0:09:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't have it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.54,0:09:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.14,0:09:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He still holds a grip on the blade\Nthat slices through the deepest hells.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.68,0:09:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Odin was one hell of a swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.84,0:09:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This sword is a beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.60,0:09:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It would take a true master to tame it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.70,0:09:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds like you're being modest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.82,0:09:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved the land of Wano by\Nwielding that sword yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.12,0:09:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a master, just like my father was.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.84,0:09:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.75,0:09:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still not good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.46,0:09:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.94,0:09:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks to me like Enma is rejoicing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.44,0:09:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pleased to have a partner like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.78,0:10:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.48,0:10:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch me, Enma.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.62,0:10:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.72,0:10:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You trying to pull one over\Non me, you cheeky brat?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.76,0:10:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.62,0:10:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me there's something\Nwrong with my repair work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.28,0:10:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're damn right there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.90,0:10:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.81,0:10:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Or do you need to get your eyes\Nchecked, you useless old fart bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.86,0:10:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who asked me to double\Ncheck your repairs, you cocky little turd.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.22,0:10:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't start pissing on me because I did you\Na favor, even if it was a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.28,0:10:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.48,0:10:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But you knew that already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.72,0:10:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You little punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.68,0:10:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.66,0:10:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You kind of left me a\Nspot to fix as a courtesy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.74,0:10:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.65,0:10:49.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I climbed up here just\Nto look like a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.32,0:10:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry you can't handle\Nmy super repair work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.08,0:10:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the shipwright\Nof the crew, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.54,0:10:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hats wouldn't have made\Nit this far if you weren't a pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.86,0:11:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So long, you damn oversized blockhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.28,0:11:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta miss your big fat mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.42,0:11:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.30,0:11:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Is everything OK back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.64,0:11:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My apologies, sir. One\Nmoment. I'm on my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.92,0:11:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, thank you for your patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.50,0:11:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,No prop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.54,0:11:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, regarding your color, it's blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.12,0:11:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, you'll look great!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.92,0:11:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Usuhachi, you're so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.42,0:11:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the most handsome man in all of Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.12,0:11:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me a smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.78,0:11:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, young madam,\Nanything for a fan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.42,0:11:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.46,0:11:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, that's not what I need?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.34,0:11:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Aha, you want a little more flair!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.98,0:11:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I've got just the thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.08,0:11:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you'll turn some heads with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.84,0:11:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so Head!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.76,0:11:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lady Killer!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.00,0:11:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen anyone\Nwear that color so well!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.22,0:11:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He's red hot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.62,0:11:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.53,0:11:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful not to fall in love with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.72,0:11:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, stop distracting me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.48,0:12:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.39,0:12:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need plain black fabric.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.02,0:12:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing fancy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.00,0:12:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna need lots and lots though, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.08,0:12:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's so terribly plain, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.40,0:12:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,A gentleman like you deserves much more!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.96,0:12:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, but it's not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.16,0:12:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell anyone, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.84,0:12:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.76,0:12:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.98,0:12:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall provide you with the\Nfinest that Wano has to offer!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.16,0:12:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice! Thanks, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.70,0:12:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.78,0:12:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that's enough for today!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.56,0:12:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.52,0:12:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanguro's special Sabo is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.66,0:12:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.57,0:12:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I can never get enough of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.08,0:12:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.80,0:12:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.71,0:12:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.80,0:12:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.32,0:12:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I like to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.14,0:12:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Chouchou.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.04,0:13:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How's it going, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.60,0:13:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, you want a pet?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.16,0:13:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What a cutie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.42,0:13:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You like that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.86,0:13:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up? You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.16,0:13:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.86,0:13:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I just realized I never thanked\Nyou for everything you did for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.96,0:13:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved my life at Onigashima.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.34,0:13:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.96,0:13:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It was my pleasure to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.18,0:13:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you sell me your Sabo tomorrow too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.60,0:13:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And the next day and the day after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.02,0:13:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like it gives me\Nthe power to do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.12,0:13:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You really know how to\Nflatter a guy, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.66,0:13:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid I'm leaving soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.84,0:13:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Already?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.75,0:13:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.66,0:13:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.20,0:13:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.11,0:13:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't suppose you could\Nspare a bowl for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.28,0:13:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Anytime, Robin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.64,0:13:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for stopping by.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.92,0:13:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And make it a hot one,\Nif you would, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.42,0:14:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am. Coming right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.36,0:14:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And can I have one, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.30,0:14:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, fine. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.64,0:14:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You're working so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.38,0:14:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, I brought you a little snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.36,0:14:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you've all earned a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.50,0:14:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the best. Thanks\Na bunch. Looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.52,0:14:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mind if I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.86,0:14:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That smells great.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.48,0:14:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And it tastes even better, I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.94,0:14:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.00,0:14:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been so busy. I\Nunderstand. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.24,0:14:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Bet it'll be worth the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.86,0:14:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure was.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.68,0:15:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.80,0:15:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Your red bean soup's the best\Nthing in the world, Otsudu?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.82,0:15:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, there's rice cakes too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.98,0:15:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm, love how it's so soft and chewy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.64,0:15:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat up, you can have as\Nmany bowls as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.20,0:15:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Tama, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.02,0:15:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I'm having fun, I\Nremembered you're gonna leave soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.44,0:15:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, I got a lump in my throat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.38,0:15:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,First Ace, then you, all\Nthe people I love, leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.30,0:16:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And after what happened to Ace, I'm\Nafraid I'll never see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.52,0:16:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.32,0:16:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave me rice when you\Nbarely had any for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.40,0:16:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We're friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.76,0:16:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never forget you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.34,0:16:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.98,0:16:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forget you either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.26,0:16:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll all be in my heart\Nno matter where you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.80,0:16:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.78,0:16:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Train hard while I'm gone. I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.00,0:16:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday, we'll meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.12,0:16:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.60,0:16:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, big friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.74,0:17:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get real strong! You'll see!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.86,0:17:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be a hero like you and Abe someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.62,0:17:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, we return to the present.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.38,0:17:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.88,0:17:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We can set sail whenever you're ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.44,0:17:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.80,0:17:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But are you really sure you\Nwant to leave like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.80,0:17:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't say goodbye\Nto Momo or to Kinamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.44,0:17:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems kind of wrong after all\Nwe've been through with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.00,0:17:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right, as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.12,0:17:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.03,0:17:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If Luffy wants to go, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.80,0:17:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why you gotta be such a bastard, Mosshead?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.16,0:17:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw off, curly brows. Hey! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.56,0:17:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Although,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.47,0:17:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,it is a bit of a shame since\Nwe shared so many adventures
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.04,0:17:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,with those two even before\Nwe came to the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.00,0:17:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It does feel a bit cold to\Nsilently sail away like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.48,0:18:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Luffy, you can make the call.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.76,0:18:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.30,0:18:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be here soon.
